#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Account verified, but no usable current workspace was returned."
msgstr ""
"Račun je potvrđen, ali nije vraćen nijedan upotrebljiv trenutačni radni "
"prostor."

msgid "Action Scheduler is outside the active runtime stack for this site."
msgstr "Action Scheduler nije dio aktivnog izvršnog sustava za ovo web-mjesto."

msgid ""
"Action Scheduler workload evidence is available after its runtime store "
"initializes."
msgstr ""
"Podaci o opterećenju Action Schedulera dostupni su nakon inicijalizacije "
"njegove baze."

msgid ""
"Action Scheduler workload is visible: %1$d pending, %2$d past-due and %3$d "
"failed actions."
msgstr ""
"Vidljivo je opterećenje Action Schedulera: %1$d na čekanju, %2$d s "
"prekoračenim rokom i %3$d neuspjelih radnji."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Activate & Prove Object Cache"
msgstr "Aktiviraj i potvrdi objektnu predmemoriju"

msgid ""
"Activate W3 Total Cache, prepare the migration, and then deactivate it "
"yourself from Plugins before YPerf claims any replacement layer."
msgstr ""
"Aktivirajte W3 Total Cache, pripremite migraciju, a zatim ga sami "
"deaktivirajte u Dodacima prije nego što YPerf preuzme upravljanje "
"predmemorijom."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Activate YPerf Object Cache & Prove"
msgstr "Aktiviraj i potvrdi YPerf objektnu predmemoriju"

#: includes/class-yperf-migration-journey.php
msgid "Activate a safe YPerf baseline"
msgstr "Aktiviraj sigurne početne postavke YPerfa"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Activate the recommended local profile"
msgstr "Aktiviraj preporučeni lokalni profil"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Activate, prove and roll back the YPerf Redis executor"
msgstr "Aktiviraj, potvrdi i po potrebi poništi izvršitelj Redis predmemorije YPerfa"

msgid "Activating the YPerf Page Cache replacement."
msgstr "Aktivira se zamjena za YPerf predmemoriju stranica."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-campaign.php
