"The deeper check only adds localhost service reachability and optional "
"capability confirmation; it is not an installation step."
msgstr ""
"Dublja provjera samo dodaje dostupnost lokalnih usluga i neobaveznu potvrdu "
"mogućnosti; nije korak instalacije."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The delivery engine is route-aware, skips cart/checkout/account and logged-"
