#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The installed YPerf Page Cache artifact is not in the reviewed compatibility"
" chain."
msgstr ""
"Instalirana YPerf datoteka predmemorije stranica nije dio pregledanog lanca "
"kompatibilnosti."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The legacy advanced-cache.php is unexpectedly large, so YPerf refused "
"automatic cleanup."
msgstr ""
"Prethodna datoteka advanced-cache.php neočekivano je velika pa je YPerf "
"odbio automatsko čišćenje."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The legacy advanced-cache.php no longer has high-confidence W3 Total Cache "
"ownership."
msgstr ""
"Za prethodnu datoteku advanced-cache.php više nije dovoljno pouzdano "
"utvrđeno vlasništvo W3 Total Cachea."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The legacy drop-in could not be captured safely, so nothing was removed."
msgstr ""
"Prethodna posebna datoteka nije mogla biti sigurno snimljena pa ništa nije "
"uklonjeno."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The legacy provider is inactive, its owned advanced-cache.php is retired, "
"and post-cleanup Runtime Acceptance is clean."
msgstr ""
"Prethodni pružatelj je neaktivan, njegova datoteka advanced-cache.php "
"uklonjena je, a provjera prihvatljivosti u radu nakon čišćenja uspješna."

msgid ""
"The live YPerf Page Cache hash differs from the stored authority record. "
"Repair is blocked for review."
msgstr ""
"Kontrolni sažetak aktivne YPerf predmemorije stranica razlikuje se od "
"spremljenog zapisa ovlasti. Popravak je blokiran radi pregleda."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The loaded YPerf drop-in did not prove its own Redis connection, database "
"and namespace."
msgstr ""
"Učitana posebna datoteka YPerfa nije potvrdila vlastitu Redis vezu, bazu ni "
"prostor naziva."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The loaded object-cache drop-in does not match the approved artifact hash."
msgstr "Učitana datoteka object-cache.php ne odgovara odobrenom kontrolnom sažetku."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The local YPerf profile is proven, but no page-cache executor is active yet."
" Run the bounded Page Cache stability campaign to prove MISS → HIT, Runtime "
"safety and repeat-HIT consistency before moving deeper into Redis or Origin "
"tuning."
msgstr ""
"Lokalni YPerf profil potvrđen je, ali izvršitelj predmemorije stranica još "
"nije aktivan. Pokrenite ograničenu kampanju stabilnosti predmemorije "
"stranica radi potvrde MISS → HIT, sigurnosti rada i dosljednosti ponovljenih"
" pogodaka prije dubljeg podešavanja Redisa ili izvornog poslužitelja."

#: includes/class-yperf-ai-advisor.php
msgid ""
"The local YPerf safety gate lowered the AI profile because current "
"deterministic evidence does not authorize the requested level."
msgstr ""
"Lokalna YPerf sigurnosna provjera smanjila je AI profil jer aktualni "
"deterministički dokazi ne dopuštaju traženu razinu."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The local profile was applied and accepted by Runtime Acceptance."
msgstr "Lokalni profil primijenjen je i prihvaćen provjerom prihvatljivosti u radu."

#: includes/class-yperf-release-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The local runtime/control-plane gates are healthy. Official WordPress Plugin"
" Check remains an external human acceptance gate and is never fabricated "
"from inside YPerf."
msgstr ""
"Lokalne provjere rada i upravljačkog sloja uspješne su. Službeni WordPress "
"Plugin Check ostaje vanjska provjera koju potvrđuje čovjek i YPerf je nikada"
" ne izmišlja."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The log is local, bounded and intended for debugging invalidation storms and"
" unexpected cache churn."
msgstr ""
"Dnevnik je lokalan, ograničen i namijenjen dijagnostici oluja poništavanja i"
" neočekivanih promjena predmemorije."

