msgstr "Učitavač upravljanog izvršnog okruženja uklonjen je."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The model catalog comes from the verified account plan; YPerf does not ship "
"a frozen provider list."
msgstr ""
"Katalog modela dolazi iz potvrđenog paketa računa; YPerf ne isporučuje "
"zamrznuti popis pružatelja."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The model requested a broader profile than current deterministic evidence "
"allows. YPerf lowered it before any Apply became possible."
msgstr ""
"Model je zatražio širi profil nego što dopuštaju aktualni deterministički "
"dokazi. YPerf ga je smanjio prije nego što je Primijeni postalo dostupno."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The native executor is adopted, but current-version Runtime Acceptance must "
"be clean before an operation plan can advance."
msgstr ""
"Izvorni izvršitelj preuzet je, ali aktualna provjera prihvatljivosti u radu "
"mora biti uspješna prije nastavka operativnog plana."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"The native proof belongs to a different hostname, so YPerf will not adopt it"
" for this site."
msgstr ""
"Izvorna potvrda pripada drugom nazivu poslužitelja pa je YPerf neće preuzeti"
" za ovo web-mjesto."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The new YPerf-owned runtime must pass before migration can finalize."
msgstr ""
"Novo izvršno okruženje pod upravljanjem YPerfa mora proći provjeru prije "
"završetka migracije."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The next Runtime Acceptance will capture query count, database time, slow-"
"query counts and query families for origin-executed frontend probes."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeća provjera prihvatljivosti u radu zabilježit će broj upita, vrijeme "
"baze, broj sporih upita i obitelji upita za probe korisničkog sučelja "
"izvršene na izvornom poslužitelju."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The object-cache drop-in template could not be rendered safely."
msgstr "Predložak datoteke objektne predmemorije nije se mogao sigurno pripremiti."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The old provider is deactivated only inside a transaction. YPerf then "
"reconciles ownership, proves execution, runs Runtime Acceptance, and "
"restores the previous provider automatically if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Prethodni pružatelj deaktivira se samo unutar transakcije. YPerf zatim "
"usklađuje vlasništvo, potvrđuje izvršavanje, provodi provjeru "
"prihvatljivosti u radu i automatski vraća prethodnog pružatelja ako potvrda "
"ne uspije."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The origin probe currently proves BYPASS, so YPerf will not claim page "
"acceleration."
msgstr ""
"Trenutačni probni zahtjev izvornog poslužitelja potvrđuje BYPASS pa YPerf "
"neće tvrditi da stranice ubrzava predmemorija."

#: assets/admin.js
msgid "The original operation may still be running. Do not start it again."
msgstr "Izvorna operacija možda se još izvršava. Nemojte je ponovno pokretati."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"The portable MU layer provides local origin protection on standard WordPress"
" hosting. Native server and edge adapters can extend protection earlier in "
"the request path."
msgstr ""
"Prenosivi MU sloj pruža lokalnu zaštitu izvornog poslužitelja na standardnom"
" WordPress hostingu. Izvorni poslužiteljski i rubni adapteri mogu proširiti "
"zaštitu na raniji dio zahtjeva."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The post-apply request set is checking public routes and safety policies."
msgstr "Skup zahtjeva nakon primjene provjerava javne putanje i sigurnosna pravila."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid ""
"The pre-migration W3 Total Cache responsibility settings could not be "
"restored automatically."
msgstr ""
"Postavke odgovornosti W3 Total Cachea prije migracije nije bilo moguće "
"automatski vratiti."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The previous YPerf profile is restored and the rollback Runtime Acceptance "
"completed."
msgstr ""
"Prethodni YPerf profil vraćen je i završena je provjera prihvatljivosti u "
"radu nakon vraćanja."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The previous YPerf settings are being restored and re-proved."
msgstr "Vraćaju se prethodne YPerf postavke i ponovno potvrđuju."

msgid ""
"The provider is already inactive. YPerf will snapshot the remaining high-"
"confidence W3TC advanced-cache.php, retire only that artifact, run Health "
"Check, and restore the exact file automatically if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Pružatelj je već neaktivan. YPerf će snimiti preostalu pouzdano potvrđenu "
"W3TC datoteku advanced-cache.php, ukloniti samo nju, provesti provjeru "
"zdravlja i automatski vratiti točnu datoteku ako potvrda ne uspije."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The provider is already inactive. YPerf will snapshot the remaining high-"
"confidence W3TC advanced-cache.php, retire only that artifact, run Runtime "
"Acceptance, and restore the exact file automatically if proof fails."
msgstr ""
"Pružatelj je već neaktivan. YPerf će snimiti preostalu pouzdano potvrđenu "
"W3TC datoteku advanced-cache.php, ukloniti samo nju, provesti provjeru "
"prihvatljivosti u radu i automatski vratiti točnu datoteku ako potvrda ne "
"uspije."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The provider responsibility could not be retired safely."
msgstr "Odgovornost pružatelja nije se mogla sigurno ukloniti."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid ""
"The provider responsibility could not be retired safely. No further "
"migration action was attempted."
msgstr ""
"Odgovornost pružatelja nije se mogla sigurno ukloniti. Daljnja migracija "
"nije pokušana."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"The provider-owned drop-in was not removed because read-back verification "
"failed."
msgstr ""
"Posebna datoteka pružatelja nije uklonjena jer provjera ponovnim očitanjem "
"nije uspjela."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The refreshed Page Cache artifact failed MISS → HIT proof and the previous "
"artifact was restored."
msgstr ""
"Osvježena datoteka predmemorije stranica nije prošla potvrdu MISS → HIT pa "
"je vraćena prethodna."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The refreshed Page Cache artifact failed its read-back hash check and was "
"rolled back."
msgstr ""
"Osvježena datoteka predmemorije stranica nije prošla provjeru kontrolnog "
"sažetka nakon upisa i promjena je poništena."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The refreshed Page Cache artifact failed proof and automatic rollback could "
"not be confirmed. Stop and review before continuing."
msgstr ""
"Osvježena datoteka predmemorije stranica nije prošla provjeru i automatsko "
"vraćanje nije potvrđeno. Zaustavite postupak i pregledajte prije nastavka."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The report can correlate frontend timing with WordPress, cache ownership, "
"PHP/runtime capabilities and application integrations instead of seeing only"
" the public page."
msgstr ""
"Izvješće može povezati vrijeme korisničkog sučelja s WordPressom, "
"vlasništvom predmemorije, PHP mogućnostima i integracijama aplikacije, "
"umjesto da prikazuje samo javnu stranicu."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The reserved Redis database could not be re-verified immediately before "
"activation."
msgstr ""
"Rezervirana Redis baza nije se mogla ponovno potvrditi neposredno prije "
"aktivacije."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The reserved Redis database is no longer empty. YPerf stopped before writing"
" object-cache.php; release the reservation and refresh Host Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Rezervirana Redis baza više nije prazna. YPerf je stao prije upisa object-"
"cache.php; oslobodite rezervaciju i osvježite podatke o poslužitelju."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The reserved Redis target failed its bounded write/read/delete proof."
msgstr ""
"Rezervirano Redis odredište nije prošlo ograničenu provjeru upisa, čitanja i"
" brisanja."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-operation-contract.php
msgid ""
"The reserved logical database is no longer the empty database proven by "
"current host evidence. Release the reservation and re-evaluate instead of "
"reusing stale isolation evidence."
msgstr ""
"Rezervirana logička baza više nije ona prazna baza potvrđena aktualnim "
"podacima poslužitelja. Oslobodite rezervaciju i ponovno procijenite umjesto "
"korištenja zastarjelih dokaza izolacije."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The restored advanced-cache.php did not match the saved rollback fingerprint."
msgstr ""
"Vraćena datoteka advanced-cache.php ne odgovara spremljenom kontrolnom "
"sažetku za vraćanje."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI User API contract is not available."
msgstr "Pregledani ugovor korisničkog API-ja Yablonsky AI-ja nije dostupan."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI authentication contract is incomplete."
msgstr "Pregledani autentifikacijski ugovor Yablonsky AI-ja nije potpun."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI compute contract is incomplete."
msgstr "Pregledani ugovor računanja Yablonsky AI-ja nije potpun."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The reviewed Yablonsky AI contract needs attention."
msgstr "Pregledani ugovor Yablonsky AI-ja zahtijeva pozornost."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The saved W3 Total Cache advanced-cache.php could not be restored."
msgstr "Spremljena datoteka advanced-cache.php W3 Total Cachea nije se mogla vratiti."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid "The saved Yablonsky AI credential could not be read. Save the key again."
msgstr ""
"Spremljenu vjerodajnicu Yablonsky AI-ja nije moguće pročitati. Ponovno "
"spremite ključ."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "The saved legacy drop-in backup failed integrity verification."
msgstr ""
"Spremljena sigurnosna kopija prethodne posebne datoteke nije prošla provjeru"
" integriteta."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected AI model is not available to this verified workspace. Refresh "
"the account catalog and choose again."
msgstr ""
"Odabrani AI model nije dostupan u ovom potvrđenom radnom prostoru. Osvježite"
" katalog računa i odaberite ponovno."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The selected YPerf baseline was applied and accepted by Runtime Acceptance."
msgstr ""
"Odabrane početne postavke YPerfa primijenjene su i prihvaćene provjerom "
"prihvatljivosti u radu."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected YPerf baseline was applied, accepted by Runtime Acceptance and "
"automatically prewarmed."
msgstr ""
"Odabrane početne postavke YPerfa primijenjene su, prihvaćene provjerom "
"prihvatljivosti u radu i automatski predzagrijane."

#: includes/class-yperf-yablonsky-ai-client.php
msgid ""
"The selected Yablonsky AI text model is not available to this verified "
"workspace."
msgstr ""
"Odabrani tekstualni model Yablonsky AI-ja nije dostupan u ovom potvrđenom "
"radnom prostoru."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The selected local profile can now be applied inside the YPerf-owned "
"WordPress boundary."
msgstr ""
"Odabrani lokalni profil sada se može primijeniti unutar WordPress kontrole "
"pod upravljanjem YPerfa."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The selected settings backup is not valid JSON."
msgstr "Odabrana sigurnosna kopija postavki nije valjan JSON."

msgid ""
"The setting changes WordPress origin delivery only. Existing external "
"Nginx/Cloudflare HTML cache entries require independent freshness "
"verification; YPerf does not silently purge host caches."
msgstr ""
"Postavka mijenja samo isporuku s izvornog WordPress poslužitelja. Postojeći "
"HTML zapisi vanjske Nginx/Cloudflare predmemorije zahtijevaju neovisnu "
"potvrdu svježine; YPerf potajno ne prazni predmemoriju poslužitelja."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "The settings backup does not contain any portable YPerf settings."
msgstr "Sigurnosna kopija postavki ne sadrži prenosive YPerf postavke."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "The settings backup is larger than the supported 256 KB safety limit."
msgstr ""
"Sigurnosna kopija postavki veća je od podržanog sigurnosnog ograničenja od "
"256 KB."

#: includes/class-yperf-control-plane-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The site is functional, but current host/FPM headroom does not prove a "
"comfortable reserve for admin work during frontend pressure. Origin Budget "
"review should preserve an explicit control-plane reserve."
msgstr ""
"Web-mjesto je funkcionalno, ali trenutačna rezerva poslužitelja i FPM-a ne "
"potvrđuje udoban kapacitet za administraciju pri opterećenju korisničkog "
"sučelja. Pregled Origin Budgeta treba očuvati izričitu rezervu upravljačkog "
"sloja."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The site is mapped to a concrete PHP-FPM pool; origin-budget recommendations"
" can now be evidence-based."
msgstr ""
"Web-mjesto povezano je s konkretnim PHP-FPM skupom; preporuke za proračun "
"izvornog poslužitelja sada se mogu temeljiti na dokazima."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-readiness.php
msgid ""
"The site pool is mapped, but no live worker RSS sample is available. Do not "
"derive an Origin Budget from configuration alone."
msgstr ""
"Skup web-mjesta mapiran je, ali nije dostupan živi uzorak RSS memorije "
"radnih procesa. Nemojte računati Origin Budget samo iz konfiguracije."

msgid "The sitemap diagnostic stayed inside its bounded execution budget."
msgstr ""
"Dijagnostika karte web-mjesta ostala je unutar ograničenog vremenskog "
"proračuna."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"The stability metric is local same-origin cache evidence, not a Google "
"PageSpeed score. Use repeated PageSpeed runs later as an external field "
"check after YPerf has proved deterministic cache execution."
msgstr ""
"Metrika stabilnosti lokalni je dokaz predmemorije istog izvora, a ne Google "
"PageSpeed ocjena. Kasnije koristite ponovljena PageSpeed mjerenja kao "
"vanjsku provjeru nakon što YPerf potvrdi determinističko izvršavanje "
"predmemorije."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid "The staged object-cache drop-in failed its read-back hash check."
msgstr ""
"Pripremljena datoteka objektne predmemorije nije prošla provjeru kontrolnog "
"sažetka nakon upisa."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"The stored Page Cache artifact hash does not match the live file. Refresh is"
" blocked."
msgstr ""
"Spremljeni kontrolni sažetak datoteke predmemorije stranica ne odgovara "
"živoj datoteci. Osvježavanje je blokirano."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-operations.php
msgid ""
"The zone is exclusive to this server block. YPerf can operate prewarm now "
"while host writes remain locked."
msgstr ""
"Zona je isključiva za ovaj blok poslužitelja. YPerf sada može provoditi "
"predzagrijavanje dok upisi na poslužitelj ostaju zaključani."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Theme contrast, accessibility styling and third-party scripts such as chat "
"widgets remain outside this write boundary. YPerf may diagnose those costs "
"later, but this campaign does not rewrite external code just to improve a "
"benchmark score."
msgstr ""
"Kontrast teme, pristupačnost stilova i skripte trećih strana poput chat "
"dodataka ostaju izvan ove granice upisa. YPerf kasnije može dijagnosticirati"
" njihove troškove, ali ova kampanja ne prepisuje vanjski kod radi boljeg "
"rezultata mjerenja."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "Think of it as PageSpeed Insights with access under the hood."
msgstr "Zamislite PageSpeed Insights s pogledom ispod haube."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "This YPerf capability is operated from its dedicated bounded workflow."
msgstr "Ovom YPerf mogućnošću upravlja se kroz njezin zasebni ograničeni postupak."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This completed migration remains visible as history. Future YPerf updates do"
" not ask you to migrate the same provider again."
msgstr ""
"Ova dovršena migracija ostaje vidljiva u povijesti. Buduća ažuriranja YPerfa"
" neće ponovno tražiti migraciju istog pružatelja."

#: includes/class-yperf-settings-transfer.php
msgid "This file is not a supported Yablonsky Performance settings backup."
msgstr "Ova datoteka nije podržana sigurnosna kopija postavki Yablonsky Performancea."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This gate turns intermittent admin incidents into explicit release/tuning "
"evidence. It never raises PHP memory, changes FPM or alters the WordPress "
"upgrader automatically."
msgstr ""
"Ova provjera pretvara povremene administracijske incidente u izričite "
"podatke za izdanje i podešavanje. Nikada automatski ne povećava PHP "
"memoriju, ne mijenja FPM ni WordPressov sustav nadogradnje."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This indicator tracks site configuration and evidence — not YPerf "
"development progress."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj pokazatelj prati konfiguraciju i dokaze web-mjesta — ne napredak "
"razvoja YPerfa."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a PHP runtime capability, not something YPerf should imitate in "
"WordPress."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je mogućnost PHP izvršnog okruženja, a ne nešto što bi YPerf trebao "
"oponašati u WordPressu."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a core YPerf advantage: first-hit work is treated separately from "
"repeat-hit cache."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je ključna prednost YPerfa: rad pri prvom učitavanju obrađuje se "
"odvojeno od ponovljenih pogodaka predmemorije."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"This is a local low-risk optimization layer; it is intentionally separate "
"from cache and server adoption."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je lokalni sloj optimizacije niskog rizika; namjerno je odvojen od "
"preuzimanja predmemorije i poslužitelja."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is separate from Site Readiness. It tracks whether the detected legacy "
"provider can be retired without losing an active responsibility."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je odvojeno od spremnosti web-mjesta. Prati može li se otkriveni "
"prethodni pružatelj ukloniti bez gubitka aktivne odgovornosti."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the answer to “what is actually working?”. Detection alone never "
"gets a green ACTIVE state."
msgstr ""
"Ovo odgovara na pitanje „što stvarno radi?”. Samo otkrivanje nikada ne daje "
"zeleni status AKTIVNO."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This is the first explicit local write boundary: YPerf may create only its "
"own wp-content/object-cache.php and namespaced Redis health/cache keys in "
"the reserved logical database."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je prva izričita granica lokalnog upisa: YPerf smije stvoriti samo "
"vlastitu datoteku wp-content/object-cache.php i Redis ključeve "
"zdravlja/predmemorije s vlastitim prostorom naziva u rezerviranoj logičkoj "
"bazi."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-responsibility-resolver.php
msgid "This provider responsibility is not supported by the guided resolver."
msgstr "Vođeni postupak ne podržava ovu odgovornost pružatelja."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This refresh is read-only: it rechecks the environment, runs Runtime "
"Acceptance and rebuilds the performance benchmark. It does not enable cache,"
" alter providers or change host configuration."
msgstr ""
"Ovo osvježavanje samo je za čitanje: ponovno provjerava okruženje, pokreće "
"provjeru prihvatljivosti u radu i obnavlja mjerenje performansi. Ne "
"uključuje predmemoriju, ne mijenja pružatelje ni konfiguraciju poslužitelja."

#: includes/class-yperf-recommendations.php
msgid ""
"This site has enough published content for publishing workflow automation to"
" become relevant. A future Yablonsky Publisher integration can use YPerf "
"performance evidence without turning the cache dashboard into an advertising"
" surface."
msgstr ""
"Web-mjesto ima dovoljno objavljenog sadržaja da automatizacija objavljivanja"
" postane korisna. Buduća integracija Yablonsky Publishera može koristiti "
"YPerfove podatke o performansama bez pretvaranja nadzorne ploče predmemorije"
" u oglasnu površinu."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This site-level view tracks optional Redis/native-host execution lanes and "
"provider-retirement evidence. It is informative and does not make optional "
"host features a market-release requirement."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj pogled web-mjesta prati neobavezne Redis i izvorne poslužiteljske "
"načine izvršavanja te dokaze o uklanjanju pružatelja. Informativan je i ne "
"čini neobavezne funkcije poslužitelja obveznima za tržišno izdanje."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This snapshot proves only part of the native stack. Run the Host Inspector "
"bundled with the current YPerf release to capture site-specific Nginx "
"ownership, Redis isolation/headroom and exact PHP-FPM worker-memory "
"evidence."
msgstr ""
"Ova snimka potvrđuje samo dio izvornog sustava. Pokrenite inspektor "
"poslužitelja priložen trenutačnom izdanju YPerfa kako biste zabilježili "
"vlasništvo Nginxa specifično za web-mjesto, izolaciju i rezervu Redisa te "
"točne podatke o memoriji PHP-FPM radnih procesa."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"This tile is evidence only. YPerf does not claim ownership of an external "
"runtime layer."
msgstr ""
"Ova pločica samo je dokaz. YPerf ne tvrdi da upravlja vanjskim izvršnim "
"slojem."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"Three frontend samples per route plus isolated Redis/Memcached localhost "
"read tests. No cache setting is changed."
msgstr ""
"Tri uzorka korisničkog sučelja po putanji te izolirani testovi čitanja "
"lokalnog Redisa/Memcacheda. Nijedna postavka predmemorije ne mijenja se."

