"YPerf ima aktualnu lokalnu rezervaciju izoliranog Redis odredišta. Nije "
"stvoren Redis ključ, posebna datoteka ni konfiguracija poslužitelja."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has adopted the existing PHP-FPM max_children limit as the site Origin"
" Budget. No host file was rewritten because the current native limit already"
" enforces the reviewed boundary."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je preuzeo postojeće PHP-FPM ograničenje max_children kao Origin "
"Budget web-mjesta. Nijedna datoteka poslužitelja nije prepisana jer "
"trenutačno izvorno ograničenje već provodi pregledanu granicu."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-readiness.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has an exact site pool, live worker-memory evidence and current "
"Runtime Acceptance. This is enough to review a bounded Origin Budget, but "
"not enough to change FPM automatically."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ima točan identitet skupa web-mjesta, žive podatke o memoriji radnih "
"procesa i aktualnu provjeru prihvatljivosti u radu. To je dovoljno za "
"pregled ograničenog Origin Budgeta, ali ne i za automatsku promjenu FPM-a."

#: includes/class-yperf-origin-budget-contract.php
msgid ""
"YPerf has exact pool identity, live worker memory evidence and a control-"
"plane reserve model. R2 freezes the reviewed before-state and rollback "
"authority without editing PHP-FPM."
msgstr ""
"YPerf ima točan identitet skupa, žive podatke o memoriji radnih procesa i "
"model rezerve upravljačkog sloja. R2 zaključava pregledano prethodno stanje "
"i mogućnost vraćanja bez uređivanja PHP-FPM-a."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf is already active"
msgstr "YPerf je već aktivan"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is applying only allowlisted performance settings, then proving them "
"by read-back."
msgstr ""
"YPerf primjenjuje samo dopuštene postavke performansi, zatim ih potvrđuje "
"ponovnim očitanjem."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is preserving the browser-cache responsibility when it was active at "
"the source."
msgstr ""
"YPerf čuva odgovornost predmemorije preglednika ako je bila aktivna u "
"izvornom sustavu."

msgid "YPerf is preserving the prepared browser-cache responsibility."
msgstr "YPerf čuva pripremljenu odgovornost predmemorije preglednika."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is purging the homepage URL through its cache authority and the "
"adopted Cloudflare purge bridge."
msgstr ""
"YPerf prazni URL početne stranice putem vlastitog upravitelja predmemorije i"
" preuzetog Cloudflare mosta za pražnjenje."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is restoring only settings it previously changed and will not "
"overwrite unrelated external drift."
msgstr ""
"YPerf vraća samo postavke koje je ranije promijenio i neće prepisati "
"nepovezane vanjske promjene."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf is warming a bounded set of high-value public URLs so the first "
"visitor does not pay the cold-cache cost."
msgstr ""
"YPerf zagrijava ograničen skup vrijednih javnih URL-ova kako prvi "
"posjetitelj ne bi snosio trošak hladne predmemorije."

#: includes/class-yperf-environment-check.php
msgid ""
"YPerf keeps this option visible so the user can install or ask the host for "
"it later."
msgstr ""
"YPerf zadržava ovu mogućnost vidljivom kako bi je korisnik kasnije mogao "
"instalirati ili zatražiti od pružatelja hostinga."

msgid ""
"YPerf made no plugin activation changes. Review the page-cache ownership "
"state before retrying."
msgstr ""
"YPerf nije promijenio aktivaciju dodataka. Pregledajte vlasništvo "
"predmemorije stranica prije ponovnog pokušaja."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf may change"
msgstr "YPerf smije promijeniti"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf may execute only the dedicated local operations whose exact contracts "
"are shown above. Host configuration writes still require a separately "
"reviewed helper with backup, exact diff, syntax test, read-back, acceptance "
"and rollback."
msgstr ""
"YPerf smije izvršiti samo namjenske lokalne operacije čiji su točni ugovori "
"prikazani iznad. Upisi u konfiguraciju poslužitelja još zahtijevaju zasebno "
"pregledan pomoćnik sa sigurnosnom kopijom, točnim razlikama, provjerom "
"sintakse, ponovnim očitanjem, prihvatljivošću i vraćanjem."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf needs current read-only Redis evidence. It can use a current Host "
"Inspector snapshot or inspect a local PhpRedis service directly without "
"writing keys or changing Redis configuration."
msgstr ""
"YPerfu trebaju aktualni Redis dokazi samo za čitanje. Može koristiti svježu "
"snimku inspektora poslužitelja ili izravno pregledati lokalni PhpRedis "
"servis bez upisa ključeva ili promjene Redis konfiguracije."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf never changes"
msgstr "YPerf nikada ne mijenja"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf object-cache drop-in was removed. Redis was not flushed or "
"reconfigured."
msgstr ""
"YPerfova posebna datoteka objektne predmemorije uklonjena je. Redis nije "
"pražnjen ni rekonfiguriran."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf owns only Rocket Loader OFF, HTTP/3 ON and purge synchronization."
msgstr ""
"YPerf upravlja samo Rocket Loaderom ISKLJUČENO, HTTP/3 UKLJUČENO i "
"sinkronizacijom pražnjenja."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the migrated layers and the post-handover Runtime Acceptance is "
"clean."
msgstr ""
"YPerf upravlja migriranim slojevima i provjera prihvatljivosti u radu nakon "
"primopredaje uspješna je."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the migrated responsibilities and post-handover Runtime "
"Acceptance is clean."
msgstr ""
"YPerf upravlja migriranim odgovornostima i provjera prihvatljivosti u radu "
"nakon primopredaje uspješna je."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf owns the portable WordPress page-cache executor, cacheability policy, "
"selective purge, prewarm, execution proof and rollback. Native server cache "
"remains a separate adoption path."
msgstr ""
"YPerf upravlja prenosivim WordPress izvršiteljem predmemorije stranica, "
"pravilima predmemoriranja, selektivnim pražnjenjem, predzagrijavanjem, "
"potvrdom izvršavanja i vraćanjem. Izvorna predmemorija poslužitelja ostaje "
"zasebna putanja preuzimanja."

msgid ""
"YPerf owns the prepared replacement layers. Another plugin’s activation "
"status was never changed by YPerf."
msgstr ""
"YPerf upravlja pripremljenim zamjenskim slojevima. YPerf nikada nije "
"mijenjao aktivacijski status drugog dodatka."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf persistent object cache is active. Redis round-trip and Runtime "
"Acceptance passed."
msgstr ""
"YPerf trajna objektna predmemorija aktivna je. Redis provjera upisa i "
"čitanja te provjera prihvatljivosti u radu uspješne su."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf policy"
msgstr "YPerf pravila"

msgid ""
"YPerf prepared the handoff but will not deactivate W3 Total Cache. Open "
"Plugins, deactivate W3 Total Cache yourself, return here, then continue. "
"This keeps plugin activation status under your control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je pripremio primopredaju, ali neće deaktivirati W3 Total Cache. "
"Otvorite Dodatke, sami deaktivirajte W3 Total Cache, vratite se i nastavite."
" Tako aktivacija dodataka ostaje pod vašom kontrolom."

msgid ""
"YPerf prepares a reversible handoff, then asks you to deactivate W3 Total "
"Cache yourself on the WordPress Plugins screen. After you return, YPerf "
"reconciles ownership, proves execution and runs Health Check. YPerf never "
"changes another plugin’s activation status."
msgstr ""
"YPerf priprema povratnu primopredaju, zatim vas traži da sami deaktivirate "
"W3 Total Cache na WordPressovu zaslonu Dodaci. Nakon povratka YPerf "
"usklađuje vlasništvo, potvrđuje izvršavanje i provodi provjeru zdravlja. "
"YPerf nikada ne mijenja aktivacijski status drugog dodatka."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf preserves an OFF source intent and activates Page Cache only when that"
" responsibility actually needs a replacement."
msgstr ""
"YPerf čuva izvornu namjeru ISKLJUČENO i aktivira predmemoriju stranica samo "
"ako tu odgovornost zaista treba zamijeniti."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reads the provider configuration through its public runtime API. It "
"does not change W3TC settings."
msgstr ""
"YPerf čita konfiguraciju pružatelja putem njegova javnog izvršnog API-ja. Ne"
" mijenja W3TC postavke."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf reads the zone settings and effective delivery state."
msgstr "YPerf očitava postavke zone i stvarno stanje isporuke."

#: includes/class-yperf-native-page-cache-adoption.php
msgid ""
"YPerf recognizes the proven Nginx FastCGI cache as the authoritative page-"
"cache executor. No server configuration was changed."
msgstr ""
"YPerf prepoznaje potvrđenu Nginx FastCGI predmemoriju kao mjerodavni "
"izvršitelj predmemorije stranica. Konfiguracija poslužitelja nije mijenjana."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf refused to remove advanced-cache.php because its W3 Total Cache "
"ownership changed before write time."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je odbio ukloniti advanced-cache.php jer se vlasništvo W3 Total Cachea"
" promijenilo prije upisa."

msgid ""
"YPerf replacement is ready; final plugin activation status remains a user "
"decision."
msgstr ""
"YPerf zamjena spremna je; konačni aktivacijski status dodatka ostaje odluka "
"korisnika."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid "YPerf response policy active"
msgstr "YPerf pravila odgovora aktivna"

msgid "YPerf restored its own changes and left plugin activation status untouched."
msgstr "YPerf je vratio vlastite promjene i nije dirao aktivacijski status dodataka."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own migration changes. If you want W3 Total Cache active "
"again, reactivate it yourself from the WordPress Plugins screen."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je poništio vlastite migracijske promjene. Ako želite ponovno "
"aktivirati W3 Total Cache, učinite to sami na WordPressovu zaslonu Dodaci."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own migration changes. W3 Total Cache remains inactive "
"until the administrator chooses to reactivate it from Plugins."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je poništio vlastite migracijske promjene. W3 Total Cache ostaje "
"neaktivan dok administrator ne odluči ponovno ga aktivirati u Dodacima."

msgid ""
"YPerf restored its own partial changes. Plugin activation status remains "
"under user control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je poništio vlastite djelomične promjene. Aktivacijski status dodataka"
" ostaje pod korisničkom kontrolom."

#: includes/class-yperf-cloudflare-edge.php
msgid "YPerf restored the Cloudflare settings it had adopted."
msgstr "YPerf je vratio Cloudflare postavke koje je preuzeo."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf restored the previous ownership state and stopped before accepting the"
" handover."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je vratio prethodno stanje vlasništva i zaustavio se prije prihvaćanja"
" primopredaje."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf restored the previous state, restored the retired W3TC responsibility "
"switches and reactivated W3 Total Cache."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je vratio prethodno stanje, vratio uklonjene prekidače odgovornosti "
"W3TC-a i ponovno aktivirao W3 Total Cache."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reverted every change made by this migration run, including the pre-"
"handover W3TC responsibility switches."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je poništio svaku promjenu u ovom pokretanju migracije, uključujući "
"prekidače odgovornosti W3TC-a prije primopredaje."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf reverted the partial handover and restored the pre-handover provider "
"responsibility switches before returning control."
msgstr ""
"YPerf je poništio djelomičnu primopredaju i vratio prekidače odgovornosti "
"pružatelja na prethodno stanje prije vraćanja kontrole."

msgid "YPerf rollback complete."
msgstr "YPerf vraćanje završeno."

msgid ""
"YPerf rollback is complete. W3 Total Cache was not reactivated "
"automatically; WordPress.org requires that activation decision to remain "
"with you."
msgstr ""
"YPerf vraćanje završeno. W3 Total Cache nije automatski ponovno aktiviran; "
"WordPress.org zahtijeva da ta odluka ostane vaša."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid "YPerf settings were imported and verified successfully."
msgstr "YPerf postavke uspješno su uvezene i potvrđene."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"YPerf stopped after attempting the protected rollback, but one rollback "
"component could not be verified. The UI will not claim a complete rollback."
msgstr ""
"YPerf se zaustavio nakon pokušaja zaštićenog vraćanja, ali jedna komponenta "
"vraćanja nije se mogla potvrditi. Sučelje neće tvrditi da je vraćanje "
"potpuno."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf treats Redis/Valkey as bounded working memory with isolation, "
"maxmemory, hit/miss and eviction visibility."
msgstr ""
"YPerf tretira Redis/Valkey kao ograničenu radnu memoriju uz vidljivost "
"izolacije, maxmemory, pogodaka/nepogodaka i izbacivanja."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf uses a site-specific namespace and generation-based cache invalidation"
" so rollback never requires deleting unrelated Redis data."
msgstr ""
"YPerf koristi prostor naziva specifičan za web-mjesto i generacijsko "
"poništavanje predmemorije, pa vraćanje nikada ne zahtijeva brisanje "
"nepovezanih Redis podataka."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not activate its portable Page Cache while an adopted native "
"executor owns page-cache authority. Review or release that adoption first if"
" you intentionally want to change executors."
msgstr ""
"YPerf neće aktivirati svoju prenosivu predmemoriju stranica dok preuzeti "
"izvorni izvršitelj upravlja predmemorijom. Najprije pregledajte ili "
"oslobodite to preuzimanje ako namjerno želite promijeniti izvršitelj."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid "YPerf will not change an advanced-cache.php whose ownership is not proven."
msgstr ""
"YPerf neće promijeniti datoteku advanced-cache.php čije vlasništvo nije "
"potvrđeno."

#: includes/class-yperf-feature-catalog.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not enable database query caching just to increase a feature "
"count. It must prove a measurable benefit beside object cache and real "
"database indexes."
msgstr ""
"YPerf neće uključiti predmemoriranje upita u bazu podataka samo radi "
"povećanja broja funkcija. Mora dokazati mjerljivu korist uz objektnu "
"predmemoriju i stvarne indekse baze."

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"YPerf will not send a credential until the HTTPS endpoint, authentication "
