msgstr "advanced-cache.php"

#: includes/class-yperf-admin.php
msgid ""
"advanced-cache.php is not a manual task. YPerf reconciles that provider-"
"owned artifact only inside the protected transactional handover."
msgstr ""
"advanced-cache.php nije ručni zadatak. YPerf usklađuje datoteku pružatelja "
"samo unutar zaštićene transakcijske primopredaje."

#: includes/class-yperf-page-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"advanced-cache.php is owned by another provider. YPerf will not overwrite it"
" outside an explicit migration handover."
msgstr ""
"advanced-cache.php pripada drugom pružatelju. YPerf je neće prepisati izvan "
"izričite migracijske primopredaje."

#: includes/class-yperf-w3tc-migration-executor.php
msgid ""
"advanced-cache.php is present, but W3 Total Cache ownership is not proven. "
"YPerf will not delete it."
msgstr ""
"advanced-cache.php postoji, ali vlasništvo W3 Total Cachea nije potvrđeno. "
"YPerf je neće izbrisati."

msgid ""
"advanced-cache.php is reconciled only after you make the plugin activation "
"decision in WordPress. YPerf never activates or deactivates another plugin."
msgstr ""
"advanced-cache.php usklađuje se tek nakon što donesete odluku o aktivaciji "
"dodatka u WordPressu. YPerf nikada ne aktivira ni deaktivira drugi dodatak."

