"koje putanje preuzimanja Redisa."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
msgid ""
"object-cache.php appeared after the contract was frozen. YPerf will not "
"overwrite it."
msgstr ""
"object-cache.php pojavio se nakon zaključavanja ugovora. YPerf ga neće "
"prepisati."

#: includes/class-yperf-object-cache-executor.php
