"object-cache.php is not owned by Yablonsky Performance. YPerf refuses to "
"remove another provider’s drop-in."
msgstr ""
"object-cache.php ne pripada Yablonsky Performanceu. YPerf odbija ukloniti "
"posebnu datoteku drugog pružatelja."

